\name{SIECCLongWeather-package}
\alias{SIECCLongWeather-package}
\alias{SIECCLongWeather}
\title{SIECC Long-Term Weather Reproduction Package}
\description{Reviewer-facing R implementation of the validated six-metric Israel long-term weather analysis for annual 1950--2025 and DJF 1950/51--2024/25.}
\details{HAC/Newey--West is primary. Modified Mann--Kendall is the autocorrelation-adjusted non-parametric sensitivity; ordinary Mann--Kendall is legacy/reference only.}
